---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About RWA Wire" description="About RWA Wire and our editorial focus on real-world assets, tokenization and institutional onchain finance.">
<section class="wire-container max-w-3xl py-16 sm:py-24">
  <p class="eyebrow text-wire">ABOUT //</p>
  <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-5xl">About RWA Wire</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-invert mt-10 max-w-none">
    <p>RWA Wire is an independent digital publication covering real-world assets, tokenization, institutional onchain finance and the infrastructure connecting traditional markets with blockchain networks.</p>
    <p>Our goal is simple: separate signal from noise. We publish timely news, research and accessible explainers designed to help readers understand how financial assets and market infrastructure are moving onchain.</p>
    <h2>Editorial approach</h2>
    <p>We aim to distinguish reported facts from analysis, link to primary or reliable sources where practical, and avoid hype-driven coverage. RWA Wire does not provide personalized investment, legal or tax advice.</p>
    <h2>Funding</h2>
    <p>RWA Wire may earn commissions from selected affiliate partnerships. Commercial relationships do not determine our editorial conclusions. Sponsored or affiliate material is disclosed where relevant.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
